1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
MEN: Will you be making the trip out to Los Angeles next Monday?

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,767
WOMAN: I was planning to, but something has come up,

3
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:12,140
so I was contemplating whether or not I should delay my trip to the week after. Why do you ask?

4
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:17,392
MEN: My brother who moved to France five years ago is coming to LA next week on a business trip,

5
00:00:17,392 --> 00:00:20,280
so I was thinking of going out there to see him.

6
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:25,040
And since I heard you are going, I thought maybe we could drive down together.

7
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,828
WOMAN: That sounds like a good idea.

8
00:00:26,828 --> 00:00:31,170
I do have to make a trip there, and it would be nice to have some company.

9
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:37,851
Hmm... tell you what, I will see what I can do to take the trip next week after all.

10
00:00:37,851 --> 00:00:42,070
Let me give you a shout with the details after lunch today.
